flowchart TB
  accTitle: Separate adapter smoke tests from the true SFT initialization
  accDescr: Save pristine adapters. A smoke branch makes a synthetic update and forks into unmerged and merged evaluation paths for parity. Independently restore pristine adapters and a fresh optimizer for the later SFT run.
  P["Save pristine zero-update adapters"] --> S["Synthetic smoke update"]
  S --> U["Unmerged evaluation"]
  S --> M["Merged evaluation copy"]
  U --> C["Compare full logits"]
  M --> C
  P --> T["Restore pristine adapters + fresh optimizer"]
  T --> F["Later SFT starts here"]
